Cell["\<\
On a path the balls shrink towards each end. At radius 2 the two ends carry a \
chain each, and the middle vertex is isolated.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"93370292-1348-4138-904b-e87584b9b45b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

